    "details": "<p><strong>About:</strong></p>\n<p>Get ready to innovate, collaborate, and build solutions that matter! Join us for an intense 24-hour hackathon where creativity meets technology.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 31st October &ndash; 1st November 2026 &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Venue: St. Vincent Pallotti College of Engineering &amp; Technology, Nagpur &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Team Size: 2&ndash;5 Members &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Mode: Direct Offline Round &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Prize Pool: ₹30,000 &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Registration Fee: ₹200 per team</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What&rsquo;s in it for you?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting challenges across 5 Kshetras / Tracks &nbsp;</li>\n<li>AI &amp; Emerging Technology &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Sustainability &amp; Environment &nbsp;</li>\n<li>️Smart Cities &amp; Civic Innovation &nbsp;</li>\n<li>️Healthcare &amp; Social Impact &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Cyber Security &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Internship Opportunities &amp; Pre-Placement Offers (PPOs)!<br />Participate, showcase your skills, and stand a chance to secure internship opportunities and pre-placement offers based on interview performance.</p>\n<p><strong>Important Accommodation Notice:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accommodation fees will be compulsory for participants opting for the provided accommodation facility and will be charged separately from the registration fee.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Official Partner: Google Developer Groups (GDG) Nagpur &nbsp;<br />Powered by: Unstop &nbsp;<br />Organized by: Rotaract Club of SVPCET</p>\n<p><strong>Register Now!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Bring your ideas. Build real solutions. Compete with the best. &nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Enter the Kshetra. Solve the Impossible.</strong></p>",
